    "Due to the failure to submit an Arboricultural Impact Assessment, Arboricultural Method Statement and Tree Protection Plan , Officers are unable to fully assess the impact of the proposed development on the existing Tree Preservation Order T.2 Oak tree  within the application site which is considered to contribute positively to the character of the area.  The applicant has therefore failed to demonstrate, through the submission of cogent information, that the proposed development would not have an unacceptable adverse impact on existing T.2 Oak Tree and therefore  would be contrary to Policies DM10 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012) and Policy G7 of the London Plan (2021)."
